{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29124","headline":"晨起白云楼寄龙兴江准上人兼呈窦秀才 · 许浑","name":"晨起白云楼寄龙兴江准上人兼呈窦秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹楼今是望乡台，乡信全稀晓鴈哀。\n山翠万重当槛出，水华千里抱城来。\n东岩月在僧初定，南浦花残客未回。\n欲吊灵均能赋否，秋风还有木兰开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}